[routes]
POST /notes                   → 201 {id, token}; the token is shown once
GET /notes/{id}               → 200 while it exists; 404 after deletion
DELETE /notes/{id}            X-Note-Token header → 204; a wrong token → 403
                              and the note is untouched

[commands]

[pages]

[files]

[notes]
the token is compared in constant time; there is no "forgot my token".
RELAY_OPEN_DELETE=1 is an exam-only bridge that waives the token; the
project's [serve.defaults] keeps it at 0, so this scenario runs at
production posture
